# R8 live probe — a query-param exclusion, a kind the doc's list does not name
site 36
declare a QUERY PARAM exclusion
    PUT /api/sites/36/config    -> 200 {"success":true,"message":"Site configuration updated successfully","config":{"id":"39db12445c66","siteId":36,"type":"web","public":true,"embedEnabled":false,"saltUserIds":false,"domain":"tcref-r8-5342a71b.tcref.test","blockBots":false,"firstPartyProxy":false,…
    (waited 11 ms for the R1 sitesAccessCache window before the read-back)
read it back
    GET /api/sites/36/excluded-query-params -> 200 {"success":true,"excludedQueryParams":["preview"]}

PROBE   POST /api/track  (querystring "?preview=1")
    -> 200 {"success":true,"message":"Event not tracked - query param excluded"}

CONTROL POST /api/track  (querystring "?utm_source=x")
    -> 200 {"success":true}

